OL,3,GNEWSADriver gives lift to PC chasing
OL,4,Acycling suspect
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have thanked a "Good Samaritan"
OL,7,Fvan driver who gave a police officer a
OL,8,Flift as he was running after a suspect.
OL,10,FSurrey Police said officers were
OL,11,Fpursuing a suspected shoplifter, who
OL,12,Fwas escaping on a bicycle, along Woking
OL,13,FRoad in Guildford on Tuesday.
OL,15,FA PC was "giving chase on foot when a
OL,16,Ffriendly van driver intervened to offer
OL,17,Fa lift", according to the force.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
