OL,3,GNEWSADriver gives lift to PC chasing
OL,4,Acycling suspect
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Working together, the van driver and
OL,7,Fofficer were able to spot where the
OL,8,Fsuspect had gone and get ahead of him,"
OL,9,Fsaid police. The suspect was arrested
OL,10,Fat the scene.
